node_modules
# Nested lockfile installs (frontend/, frontend-admin/, backend/target) live below
# the context root, so bare names above do not match them — use ** globs. Without
# this the local pnpm node_modules (symlinks) is shipped into the build context and
# `COPY frontend/ ./` fails trying to overlay symlinks onto npm ci's directories.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/target
npm-debug.log
dist
build
.git
.gitignore
